  "description": "Aquila.AppCore is a .NET MAUI application core framework designed to improve performance and user experience in data-heavy mobile applications. It provides:\n\nPreloading of screens and data in the background\n\nChunked loading for CollectionViews to handle thousands of items smoothly\n\nAutomatic refresh and reload of pages without re-fetching all data\n\nIntegration-ready MVVM structure using DI, without modifying the underlying AppCore services",
